   b) selling, renting, licensing, or otherwise using the Software or any part
      of it for any commercial purpose, including pre-installing it on
      vehicles or head units that are sold, rented or serviced for payment;
   c) modifying the Software and distributing the modified version, or
      creating and distributing derivative works based on it;
   d) using substantial parts of the source code, the BLE protocol
      implementation, the user interface design, icons or images in another
      product;
